,"archived_by":null},{"id":2304948121,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyMzA0OTQ4MTIx","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:codestyle","name":"topic:codestyle","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","number":16,"title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":5793,"closed_issues":0,"state":"open","created_at":"2022-07-26T12:42:05Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T14:39:14Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":0,"created_at":"2025-06-05T16:13:16Z","updated_at":"2026-02-17T20:10:24Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107162","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107162","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107162.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107162.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"`HashMap` and `AHashMap` currently use the same code in `erase` and `replace_key`. The code isn't trivial, so having it duplicated increases maintenance burden.\r\n\r\nI used the opportunity to fix a few other small oddities:\r\n- I exchanged one use of `fastmod` to `increment_mod`, which is faster.\r\n- Elements are no longer swapped to their predecessor. Instead, they are only propagated backwards, eliminating half of the write calls.\r\n- Checks in `erase` for `head_element` and `tail_element` were essentially performed twice. I consolidated the checks.\r\n- `_insert_element` in `HashMap` previously incremented `num_elements`, which was needed only for one of 3 callers. I moved the incrementing instead to the caller.\r\n\r\n## Benchmarks\r\n\r\nI checked performance for `erase`. It is, on average, 3% faster after the change (hot hash map):\r\n```c++\r\n\tfor (int size : { 1, 2, 8, 64, 1024, 4096, 20000}) {\r\n\t\t{\r\n\t\t\tsize_t time_ns = 0;\r\n\t\t\tfor (int run = 0; run < 20000000 / size; run++) {\r\n\t\t\t\tHashMap<Variant, Variant, VariantHasher, VariantComparator> dictionary;\r\n\t\t\t\tfor (int idx = 0; idx < size; idx ++) {\r\n\t\t\t\t\t// Test\r\n\t\t\t\t\tdictionary.insert(idx, idx);\r\n\t\t\t\t}\r\n\t\t\t\tauto t0 = std::chrono::high_resolution_clock::now();\r\n\t\t\t\tfor (int idx = 0; idx < size; idx ++) {\r\n\t\t\t\t\t// Test\r\n\t\t\t\t\tdictionary.erase(idx);\r\n\t\t\t\t}\r\n\t\t\t\tauto t1 = std::chrono::high_resolution_clock::now();\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\ttime_ns += std::chrono::duration_cast<std::chrono::nanoseconds>(t1 - t0).count();\r\n\t\t\t}\r\n\r\n\t\t\tstd::cout << \"erase:\" << size << std::endl;\r\n\t\t\tstd::cout << time_ns / 1000 / 1000 << \"ms\\n\";\r\n\t\t}\r\n\t}\r\n```","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107162/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107162/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}